      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAPERBOY (4) has raced below best last couple, the latest managing only 5th (26.28) last time in a Grade 6 at Murray Bridge. Great record here at the trip having never missed the frame including one win. Has claims if he runs up to expectations. NO FIZZY DRINK (1) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at this track over 350m (19.75). Comes through a solid form race last start. Can do much better this time. RIO HOPE (2) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a one length second (19.55) behind Dolan at this track. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Expected to be in the finish again. CERISE (6) picked up a cheque in slick time most recently - in the mix again.",
